.PP
The shared row of mbedded\-cbor counts the lazy form.
The structs form is 1 line.
The shared rows of nlohmann/json and libcbor are left out, because their
snippets show that the feature is absent.
.SS 9. Measurements
\f[CR]bench/results/2026\-10\-09\-025729Z.json\f[R] holds the only
measurement in bench/results that runs mbedded\-cbor, FlatBuffers and
Cap\(aqn Proto on the same data with the commit of a recent tree
(f2b1e56).
The operations are in \f[CR]bench/compare.cpp\f[R].
The mbedded\-cbor arm uses \f[CR]cbor::schema\f[R] (Packed CBOR), not
the at_path and lazy forms of sections 2 and 4.
FlatBuffers runs without its Verifier.
The build is g++\-16 16.2.0, \-O2 \-march=native \-falign\-functions=64
\-falign\-loops=64 \-fPIE \-pie, podman image
mbedded\-cbor\-tw\-compare, 10 rounds.
Each value is the median in nanoseconds per operation.
