.TE
.PP
RFC 8949 section 5.2 lets a decoder refuse a value that it does not
support.
Where a decoder supports a value, it reads the same value that
mbedded\-cbor wrote.
libcbor 0.14.0 reads tag 6 and so reads Packed CBOR.
A decoder that does not know a tag gives the tag number and its content
(RFC 8949 section 3.4).
jsoncons gives the content without the tag number.
